WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.398
DeepJoint is a robust survival model for clinical data.

00:00:03.478 --> 00:00:07.699
In medicine, when and which tests get ordered is
itself informative,

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:10.292
reflecting how clinicians treat patients,

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:13.328
a phenomenon the authors call clinical presence.

00:00:13.408 --> 00:00:17.249
When these patterns shift, standard prediction
models degrade.

00:00:17.329 --> 00:00:24.332
DeepJoint is a multi-task recurrent network that
models three clinical presence processes jointly with survival,

00:00:24.412 --> 00:00:28.190
delivering both strong discrimination and greater
robustness.
